# A real credential file, found untracked and unignored on 2026-09-18: it holds
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET and ICLOUD_MAIL_APP_PASSWORD, so any `git add -A` would
# have committed live secrets. `.env.example` stays tracked on purpose -- it is the
# template -- so this is a named entry rather than a blanket `.env*` pattern.
.env.save
